    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are pleased to present this strategically located parcel of development land extending to approximately 1.36 acres (inclusive of circa 0.069 acres of road frontage), situated within the development boundary of Killeagh Village, Co. Cork.\r\nOccupying a prominent position with frontage onto the Killeagh to Mount Uniacke Road (L3806), the lands represent a significant opportunity for residential or mixed-use development, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permissions.\r\nKilleagh is identified as a Key Village within the Greater Cork Ring Strategic Planning Area under the Cork County Development Plan. The plan outlines a vision for the continued expansion and regeneration of the village, with a targeted population increase from 899 persons to approximately 1,150 persons and a requirement for the delivery of approximately 96 additional residential units by 2028.\r\nThe subject lands are located within the village development boundary where future growth is directed and where residential development is actively encouraged, subject to compliance with planning policy and infrastructure capacity.\r\n\r\nGUIDE PRICE: €395,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The Cork County Development Plan highlights the need for:\r\n•\tAdditional residential development to accommodate projected population growth.\r\n•\tWell-integrated housing schemes within walking distance of village services.\r\n•\tServiced sites and self-build opportunities as alternatives to one-off rural housing.\r\n•\tMixed-use and infill development opportunities within the settlement boundary.\r\n\r\nKilleagh continues to benefit from excellent connectivity and a strong range of local amenities including primary education facilities, retail services, pharmacy, veterinary services, sporting organisations, cafés, public houses and community facilities. The village also enjoys convenient access to Midleton, Youghal, the N25 corridor and the Midleton to Youghal Greenway.\r\n\r\nThe lands are bounded by mature hedgerows and occupy an attractive setting on the edge of the village, offering the potential to deliver a thoughtfully designed development that complements the future growth objectives of Killeagh.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial parcel of land within a designated growth settlement in East Cork, presenting potential for residential development, serviced sites or a carefully considered mixed-use scheme, subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe property is being offered for sale not subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nFor further information, maps and planning details, contact Hegarty Properties.\r\n\r\nPhotography for identification purposes only."
      },
      {
